{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（ 19日）上午10時23分，警方接報港鐵旺角東站有職員在梯間暈倒，不省人事。救護員接報到場時事主回復清醒，經初步檢查後將事主送往廣華醫院治理。</p><figure><img alt=\"職員在港鐵旺角東站一梯間暈倒。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260619/1144592185229185024904125.jpeg/pNc8Mr_CGyeNIGDzMytuP8zDEds6-_peGvnL9zD5y_c\"/><figcaption>職員在港鐵旺角東站一梯間暈倒。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救援人員將事主送往廣華醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260619/1144592176659828736312758.jpeg/Zczt6WZmR1adMreKRu_W7gL2vTR7b45p50YiSM1GIkg\"/><figcaption>救援人員將事主送往廣華醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"港鐵旺角東站一梯間有職員暈倒。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260619/1144592182188183552937410.jpeg/0XYE3Xsk-M7dq9w9PqwJmSTrTI7G1t4-8VstGttbLRo\"/><figcaption>港鐵旺角東站一梯間有職員暈倒。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-19T02:58:40.805593+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}